OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786385905
OL,3,CStudent police officer arrested on
OL,4,Csuspicion of rape and kidnap
OL,6,FA student police officer has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of rape and
OL,8,Fkidnap after a 999 call from a woman
OL,9,F"in distress" in a car.
OL,11,FThe 23-year-old, who was a student
OL,12,Fstill in training with Greater
OL,13,FManchester Police (GMP), was stopped
OL,14,Fin his personal vehicle while off duty
OL,15,Ffollowing a chase on the M62 from
OL,16,FManchester to West Yorkshire.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
