OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786385905
OL,3,CStudent police officer arrested on
OL,4,Csuspicion of rape and kidnap
OL,6,FIt came after officers received the
OL,7,Femergency call from the woman around
OL,8,F10.18pm on 8 August, before quickly
OL,9,Fidentifying the suspected vehicle and
OL,10,Fbeginning a pursuit.
OL,12,FAfter stopping the vehicle the man was
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion of kidnap, rape
OL,14,Fand dangerous driving.
OL,16,FHe has been suspended and the force
OL,17,Fhas made a voluntary referral to the
OL,18,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,19,F(IOPC), GMP said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786385905
OL,3,CStudent police officer arrested on
OL,4,Csuspicion of rape and kidnap
OL,6,FThe victim - a woman in her 20s -is
OL,7,Fbeing supported by specialist officers
OL,8,Fand agencies.
OL,10,F"This is quite clearly a deeply
OL,11,Fconcerning and disturbing incident
OL,12,Fthat we are fully investigating with
OL,13,Fspecialist resources to ensure the
OL,14,Fvictim receives support and justice,"
OL,15,FAssistant Chief Constable Mark Dexter
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786385905
OL,3,CStudent police officer arrested on
OL,4,Csuspicion of rape and kidnap
OL,6,F"I can give our full commitment to
OL,7,Fworking with the Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService to bring this case to court as
OL,9,Fquickly as possible, as well as
OL,10,Faccelerating the necessary misconduct
OL,11,Fproceedings within the regulations.
OL,13,F"Thousands of the men and women in GMP
OL,14,Fwork every day to protect the public.
OL,15,FI know they, like me, will be shocked
OL,16,Fand angered by this news.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
