OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786385905
OL,3,CStudent police officer arrested on
OL,4,Csuspicion of rape and kidnap
OL,6,F"Our Professional Standards
OL,7,FDirectorate has conducted an initial
OL,8,Freview and found his vetting was
OL,9,Fcompleted without any reason for
OL,10,Fconcern.
OL,12,F"This does not, however, lessen the
OL,13,Fseverity of these allegations. All
OL,14,Fnecessary and decisive action will be
OL,15,Ftaken in the interest of the victim
OL,16,Fand the public."
